  "grain": "One national external-trade index by year, metric and trade flow",
  "notes": [
    "Five annual CBSL index series for 2021–2025 reproduced in DCS table 9.8: import and export value indices, import and export volume indices, and terms of trade. The published base is 2010=100. The source defines terms of trade as the export unit-price index divided by the import unit-price index, multiplied by 100."
